  "releaseNotes": "## Changes\n\n## 🚀 Features\n\n- Use yield return for some IEnumerable\\<T> methods @alastairlundy (#79)\n- Deprecate additional ICollection\\<T> methods and ``FrequencyOf\\<T>`` @alastairlundy (#78)\n- Add WindowsFilePermission ``HasExecutePermission``, ``HasWritePermission``, and ``HasReadPermission`` extensions @alastairlundy (#75)\n- Add FileInfo ``GetFileSizeString`` and ``GetFileSizeUnitString`` @alastairlundy (#74)\n- Add Digit counting extensions @alastairlundy (#73)\n- Add Span ``InsertRange(ICollection\\<T>, int)`` @alastairlundy (#70)\n- Add Span ``CopyTo(out Span\\<T>, int)`` and ``CopyTo(out Span\\<T>, int, int)`` @alastairlundy (#71)\n- Add Span ``ForEach(Action\\<T>`` and ``ForEach(Func\\<T, T>)`` @alastairlundy (#68)\n- Add Span ``ToList\\<T>()`` @alastairlundy (#67)\n\n## 🧰 Maintenance\n\n- Re-organize DotExtensions directory structure @alastairlundy (#72)",
